  'miguel-live-in-sa-2027-05-23', 'Miguel Live in SA', 'Music', '2027-05-23', 'Evening show',
  'SunBet Arena, Time Square', 'Waterkloof Glen', '209 Aramist Ave, Waterkloof Glen, Pretoria',
  'From R950 per person', 'https://www.suninternational.com/time-square/events/miguel-live-in-sa', 'Sold via Webtickets',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  'Vertex Events', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,
  'Grammy Award-winning R&B singer Miguel returns to South Africa in May 2027 for a three-city run, with the Pretoria leg landing at the SunBet Arena at Time Square on Sunday, 23 May. It follows stops in Cape Town''s Grand Arena at GrandWest on 21 May and the Sun City Superbowl on 22 May.

The show draws on a catalogue that spans five studio albums of R&B, soul and rock, mixing hits such as ''Adorn'', ''Sure Thing'', ''Skywalker'' and ''How Many Drinks'' with songs from across his career. Tickets are sold through Webtickets and at selected Pick n Pay stores nationwide. The tour is promoted by Vertex Events.',
  'agent',
  '["https://www.suninternational.com/time-square/events/miguel-live-in-sa", "https://www.timeslive.co.za/tshisa-live/2026-08-21-miguel-to-return-to-sa-in-may-2027-for-three-shows/", "https://www.musicinafrica.net/magazine/miguel-to-return-to-south-africa-for-three-live-shows/"]'
);
